WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.120
I'm the shell that wrapped Perseverance as it plunged through the Martian sky at about 20,000 km/h.

2
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:16.750
I opened a giant parachute, let go, and crashed.

3
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:24.620
A year later, a helicopter flew over to take my picture so engineers could see how I survived.

4
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.320
I carried Perseverance down, then let go.
